<p>Thaloren are part of the wood; it shields them from corruption.</p><p>Increase disease immunity by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">24%, 44%, 56%, 64%, 70%,</acronym> blight resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3.0%, 5.3%, 7.1%, 8.7%, 10%,</acronym> and all resistances by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.0%, 3.5%, 4.7%, 5.6%, 6.5%.</acronym></p>